@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Edition messages
+
+Public entry: `contract.ts`. Static ui-layer dictionaries, without runtime dependencies or mutable state. Each native locale imports and spreads one dictionary. The 130 keys in each language were absent from official base `3c5b227`; upstream native keys are not moved or overridden. Existing request-security messages retain their independent entry.
+
+Keys and interpolation parameters must match between languages. The extraction fingerprint fixture captures the exact pre-refactor key/value pairs; contract tests verify fingerprints and native-locale integration. No authorization, protocol or locale-selection behavior changes. See `docs/design/settings-compaction-minimal-integration.md`.
