@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Compaction settings UI
+
+Public entry: `contract.ts`. Layer: ui; requires shared and ui. SettingsPage injects the accepted settings projection and its existing asynchronous patch command. No direct service access, persistence, broadcast or independent accepted state.
+
+Defaults: detailed, 15,000 tail tokens, 8,000 output tokens. Budgets are editable only in compact mode. Local drafts validate before submission; pending refs deduplicate same-frame events. Failed commands retain drafts and show localized retryable errors. Incoming accepted numeric values replace drafts. No change to desktop/mobile/remote routing or useSettings save/sync/broadcast ordering.
+
+`AdvancedSection` preserves the existing callback contract for compatibility. The page uses `CompactionSettingsSection` once, rather than creating three forwarding callbacks. Regression evidence is in `contract.test.ts` and the existing compaction settings and policy hook tests. See `docs/design/settings-compaction-minimal-integration.md`.
