+++ b/packages/ui/src/v4/status-capsule/CONTRACT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Status capsule UI
+
+- Owner: conversation UI. `useAppPanels` remains the sole owner of right-side pane state.
+- `withSidePaneCapsuleScope(Component)` projects `sidePaneOpen` into the main conversation subtree. Create the wrapper at module scope; changing its identity would remount sessions.
+- `StatusCapsuleMetric` changes only capsule presentation: full content when the pane is closed, icon-only when open. Its full content remains available to accessibility APIs.
+- `StatusCapsuleButton` forwards the trigger ref and attributes and merges the tooltip description with a unique description pointing to the existing summary content.
+- No persistence, effects, width measurement, protocol changes, or side-pane commands.
+- Default context is noncompact, so sibling side-pane conversations retain normal presentation.
+- Public runtime entry point: `index.ts`; leaf props: `contract.ts`.
+- Spec: `docs/ui/status-capsule-side-pane.md`. Regression: `packages/ui/test/v4StatusCapsuleSidePane.test.ts` and browser fixture alongside its `.test.mjs`.
